WEBVTT

NOTE Narration is displayed in the caption strip below the video by default.

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.254
Use the CLEAR review already learned in Journey Two.

00:00:04.254 --> 00:00:07.090
Correct checks the facts and commitments.

00:00:07.090 --> 00:00:08.980
Listener checks audience fit.

00:00:08.980 --> 00:00:11.816
Enough checks missing information and repetition.

00:00:11.816 --> 00:00:14.179
Appropriate checks tone and setting.

00:00:14.179 --> 00:00:17.960
Responsible checks privacy, risk, fairness, authority and accountability.

00:00:17.960 --> 00:00:23.632
Review the message yourself, then use AI critique only as additional input.

00:00:23.632 --> 00:00:28.831
Verify important claims with approved sources and the actual checking date.

00:00:28.831 --> 00:00:34.502
Correct one unsupported reassurance with a specific action, owner and honest limit.

00:00:34.502 --> 00:00:41.592
Record a concise summary of the existing CLEAR findings instead of making another review form.

00:00:41.592 --> 00:00:45.846
Save the final message and one chosen audience adaptation.

00:00:45.846 --> 00:00:51.045
If approval is pending, retain them as drafts for human review.

00:00:51.045 --> 00:00:56.244
If you report approval, name the actual human owner and reference.

00:00:56.244 --> 00:01:00.970
AI wording and a saved record cannot supply that approval.
